---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About the author and this archive">
  <main class="page-shell about-page">
    <section class="about-hero editorial-frame">
      <span class="obs-id">SEC.01 // PROFILE</span>
      <div>
        <span class="obs-eyebrow">About / identity note</span>
        <h1>Hi, I am BF.</h1>
      </div>
      <p>
        I write as BFladderbean: a front-end developer, learner, and curious systems tinkerer. This archive collects notes about web development, mathematics, machine learning, philosophy, games, and anything else that asks for a place to land.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-grid">
      <article class="obs-frame obs-hover">
        <span class="obs-eyebrow">NOTE.A</span>
        <h2>What I make</h2>
        <p>I build web interfaces, study technical systems, and document the patterns I want future-me to find again.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="obs-frame obs-hover">
        <span class="obs-eyebrow">NOTE.B</span>
        <h2>What I notice</h2>
        <p>Games, tools, diagrams, proofs, interaction details, and the strange emotional weather of learning hard things.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="obs-frame obs-hover">
        <span class="obs-eyebrow">NOTE.C</span>
        <h2>Why the blog</h2>
        <p>Because thinking becomes more useful when it has a shape: tags, routes, fragments, and enough friction to become memorable.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(18rem, 0.7fr);
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    padding: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-hero p {
    align-self: end;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-grid article {
    min-height: 17rem;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    display: grid;
    align-content: space-between;
  }

  .about-grid h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-hero,
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
